 "remarks": "Very Spacious, Top Floor, West Facing Apartment with great sunshine & views! Newer, very pretty apartment in sought after Westwood features open designer kitchen with stainless steel appliances, wide open floor plan with sunny rooms lined with large windows, central air, gas heat, excellent closet space and personal, in-unit washer & dryer. The popular & elegant Westwood community features impeccable maintenance and grounds care. This fabulous, top floor apartment is an end unit in a secure mid-rise building with a small fitness center and 24-hour security. Pets are Ok, Dogs  35 Lbs. only, 2-Cats Ok or 1-dog and 1-cat OK ($300 fully refundable pet deposit required). Westwood is a No Smoking Community WITH NO ADDITIONAL FEES. This is a great apartment! Please have interested prospects submit the Westwood application uploaded in supplements with a credit check through Rentspree or Applyconnect only.  This apartment will be professionally cleaned, polished and beautifully presented to the new resident. PLEASE NOTE - THIS IS AN APARTMENT IN A SECURE MID-RISE BUILDING, NOT A STAND ALONE TOWNHOME.",
